  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-05-12T06:52:20.189Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "this feature was very useful when it came to avatar testing. this allowed me to see the mistakes, bugs and generally issues PROPERLY with my avatar from the second client, but someone decided to post a canny to remove this feature for no straight reason. this has been a problem for me with my newly uploaded avatars since the last update. no game ruining bugs or exploits were encountered before the update. ive encountered players with the same idea using this to test their avatars instead of using mirrors which are laggy and cant display everything accurately aswell as blind spots like the internals and the back. the feature was a easy and simple to test avatars without having the trouble to create another account or ask a friend to check it. please bring this back or have another alternative to this \"bug\"less issue.",
